OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK's Richard Tice
OL,4,Aquestioned on Farage, council tax and
OL,5,Amigration on BBC local radio
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, he tells BBC Radio
OL,8,FNewcastle's Anna Foster that "no one's
OL,9,Fperfect" and his party are "doing their
OL,10,Fvery best" when asked about Reform
OL,11,Fresignations and suspensions in the
OL,12,Fnorth east
OL,14,FReform UK's deputy leader also faced
OL,15,Fquestions on council tax and climate
OL,16,Fchange - here's a recap of what he said
OL,18,FThe BBC local radio round has been a
OL,19,Fpre-conference tradition for many
OL,20,Fyears. Labour, the Conservatives, Lib
OL,21,FDems and Greens will have a similar
OL,22,Fopportunity before their conferences
